{"video":"TvJzrKFPm60","lines":[{"t":[0,2.2],"en":"-No women or children, unless provoked."},{"t":[2.2,3.5],"en":"-Okay. Roy."},{"t":[3.5,5.6],"en":"-Warehouse guy. Doesn't count."},{"t":[5.6,7.9],"en":"-Okay. Michael, could you beat up Michael?"},{"t":[7.9,10.2],"en":"-Yeah. -Yeah, I don't think that would happen."},{"t":[10.2,13.1],"en":"-'Cause we're friends. -Because I would kick his ass."},{"t":[13.1,15.8],"en":"-Well, so it's a purple belt, so..."},{"t":[15.8,18.8],"en":"-So? I'd beat up black belts, yeah."},{"t":[18.8,20.8],"en":"-And how did you know there were black belts?"},{"t":[20.8,23.4],"en":"-They told me, after."},{"t":[23.4,25.8],"en":"See, I used to run with a very tough crowd,"},{"t":[25.8,30.3],"en":"street fighter types, real, real bad people."},{"t":[30.3,32.6],"en":"I'm just lucky I got out."},{"t":[32.6,35.8],"en":"Nobody ever messed with the damn rascals ever again."},{"t":[35.8,37.7],"en":"-Sounds tough."},{"t":[37.7,40.1],"en":"When you're a jet, you're a jet all the way, right?"},{"t":[40.1,41.2],"en":"-You're a jet?"},{"t":[41.2,42.7],"en":"-Have you signed the expense reports yet?"},{"t":[42.7,44.6],"en":"-Yes. In theory, I have."},{"t":[44.6,48.6],"en":"I just need to cross some T's and dot some I's."},{"t":[48.6,50.3],"en":"All right."},{"t":[50.3,54.5],"en":"I am going to be in my office if anybody needs me."},{"t":[54.5,56.5],"en":"-Hoo! Ha! -Oh!"},{"t":[56.5,58.8],"en":"-Michael! Wow! Sleeper hold!"},{"t":[58.8,60.7],"en":"Bedtime for Bonzo! Come on!"},{"t":[60.7,62],"en":"Oh, shh!"},{"t":[62,64.9],"en":"Oh! You are the weakest link!"},{"t":[64.9,68.5],"en":"-Oh! -I'm friends with everybody in this office."},{"t":[68.5,69.8],"en":"We're all best friends."},{"t":[69.8,71.5],"en":"I love everybody here."},{"t":[71.5,74.5],"en":"But sometimes your best friends"},{"t":[74.5,76.9],"en":"start coming into work late"},{"t":[76.9,79.1],"en":"and start having dentist appointments"},{"t":[79.1,80.4],"en":"that aren't dentist appointments,"},{"t":[80.4,82.6],"en":"and that is when it's nice to let them know"},{"t":[82.6,84.9],"en":"that you could beat them up."},{"t":[84.9,86.7],"en":"Just hit me. You'll see."},{"t":[86.7,89.1],"en":"-I can't, 'cause, uh, I just got a manicure, so..."},{"t":[89.1,91],"en":"-Oh, queer!"},{"t":[91,92.2],"en":"Eye. Queer Eye."},{"t":[92.2,94.3],"en":"That's a good show. Important show."},{"t":[94.3,95.8],"en":"Go ahead. Do it."},{"t":[95.8,98.2],"en":"-Just have Dwight punch you. -Oh, yeah."},{"t":[98.2,99.4],"en":"Well, that would be kind of worthless,"},{"t":[99.4,101.6],"en":"because I know a ton of 14-year-old girls"},{"t":[101.6,102.5],"en":"that could kick his ass."},{"t":[102.5,104.2],"en":"-You know a ton of 14-year-old girls?"},{"t":[104.2,105.5],"en":"-What belt are they?"},{"t":[105.5,107.8],"en":"-Look, Dwight is a wuss."},{"t":[107.8,109],"en":"When we rented Armageddon,"},{"t":[109,110.1],"en":"-No. -He cried at the end of it."},{"t":[110.1,111.4],"en":"We did. -Michael, I told you."},{"t":[111.4,112.9],"en":"That was because it was New Year's Eve,"},{"t":[112.9,115.2],"en":"and it started to snow at exactly midnight."},{"t":[115.2,116.2],"en":"-Oh, man. Is Bruce Willis"},{"t":[116.2,117.7],"en":"taking a leave on the asteroid?"},{"t":[117.7,119.2],"en":"Boo! -Okay. I'll punch you."},{"t":[119.2,120.7],"en":"-Oh, okay. Here we go."},{"t":[120.7,122],"en":"All right! Come on!"},{"t":[122,123],"en":"Get out!"},{"t":[123,125.4],"en":"Fuck!"},{"t":[125.4,128],"en":"- -Oh!"},{"t":[128,129.7],"en":"-Did I want to harm Michael?"},{"t":[129.7,131.8],"en":"The one man I've been hired to protect?"},{"t":[131.8,133.4],"en":"No, I did not."},{"t":[133.4,135.1],"en":"-Are you okay? -Yes."},{"t":[135.1,136.2],"en":"-Are you sure you're all right? -Yep."},{"t":[136.2,139.8],"en":"-Thank you. -Thank you."}]}
